      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've run into this issue as well using the most recent SDK3 package. The avatar will list an empty Blueprint ID, the control panel will recognize an avatar that hasn't been uploaded yet, and the SDK will package everything properly until it tries to upload it. It seems to either assign a blueprint ID that is already occupied, or assign a new ID and log you out in the middle of the process, assigning the ID to no one, but still marking the ID as occupied. The generated IDs still appear to be random. The SDK will always log you out when encountering this error, whether that's a symptom of the error or the cause of it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
