  "details": "I suddenly ran into a bug where I couldn't upload my avatar.\nI've uploaded several avatars, but this is the first time I can't cope.\nDetaching the Blueprint ID of the Pipeline Manager does not solve the problem.\nThe error message is:\nthe signed in account does not have acces to the blueprint associated with your VRC_Avatar(or Scene) Descriptor.\nPlease sign in with the correct account or detach the Blueprint ID (accessible on the VRC_PipelineManager) associated with the descriptor.",
